      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a bit of an unusual way to frame an audit, but I understand the need for a systematic approach. Regarding the \"tracing back to the source\" part: if these amounts are truly small and scattered across different departments, how do I differentiate between simple human error (like a typo or a missed receipt) and something more intentional or systemic? I want to be able to categorize these findings clearly in my report.",
